```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title Dynamic Assets Flow

    box LightBlue Asset Creation
        actor Admin
        participant API as GraphQL API
        participant Org as Organization<br/>Service
    end

    box LightGreen Storage & Signing
        participant SpecialOrg as Special Org<br/>(ASSET_SUPPORT_V2)
        participant HSM
    end

    box LightYellow Asset Registry Service
        participant Cron as Cron Job<br/>(60s)
        participant DB as Database
    end

    box LightPink Client Services
        participant Client as AssetTypes<br/>Client (10s)
        participant Cache
        participant Services
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,HSM: 1. Asset Addition & Approval

        Admin->>API: Add Asset Support<br/>(name, network, decimals, etc.)
        API->>Org: Create organization change
        Org->>HSM: Sign organization with new asset
        HSM->>SpecialOrg: Store signed organization ✓
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Cron,DB: 2. Asset Registry Sync

        Cron->>SpecialOrg: Get special org (every 60s)
        SpecialOrg->>Cron: Return all AssetConfigs
        Cron->>DB: Upsert asset records
        Note right of DB: Stores asset metadata:<br/>name, decimals, networkID, etc.
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Client,Cache: 3. Client Cache Population

        Client->>DB: ListAssetTypes gRPC (every 10s)
        DB->>Client: Return asset list
        Client->>Cache: Update in-memory cache
        Note right of Cache: Maps assetTypeID -> AssetInfo<br/>Triggers callbacks for consumers
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over Services,Cache: 4. Service Usage

        Services->>Client: Get asset info by ID
        Client->>Cache: Lookup in cache
        Cache->>Client: Return AssetInfo
        Client->>Services: Asset details available
    end
```
